  "title": "Attach multiple line labels to a path",
  "product": "Confluence",
  "status": "released",
  "description": "You can now attach multiple line labels to a path and drag labels off paths in Confluence whiteboards. This update gives you more flexibility to organize and clarify your diagrams, making it easier to communicate complex ideas visually. Open a whiteboard in Confluence.\n\tSelect a path on your diagram.\n\tAdd or edit line labels as needed. You can now attach more than one label to the same path and drag existing labels off paths.",
